              "block_type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Use the shift test on the additive memoryless rule $y(t)=x(t)+5$. The cue is the fixed output offset $+5$, so the comparison is between the shifted-input path and the output obtained by shifting the original result.",
              "latex": "",
